# e on a transmission is refused.
# References: ADR-1100 D14.
# spec: kitty graphics protocol (sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/graphics-protocol, read 2026-11-13), "Querying support for protocol features": "The e key is only allowed in query actions, and the feature query must have the i key set, as for any other query action."; ADR-1100 D14, "`e` on another action"
# covers: image.kitty
size 20 10
send "\e_Ga=t,i=48,e=T,f=24,s=1,v=1;AAAA\e\\"
send "\e_Ga=p,i=48,C=1\e\\"
